OL,3,GNEWSAGCSE students urged to consider
OL,4,Adegree apprenticeships
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeenagers across the country are
OL,7,Fgetting their GCSE results today and
OL,8,Ftheir thoughts may well be turning to
OL,9,Fwhat comes next in life.
OL,11,FFor Dominic Bates, taking on a degree
OL,12,Fapprenticeship worked for him, after
OL,13,Fstudying for A-levels during the Covid
OL,14,Fpandemic and leaving after not getting
OL,15,Fthe results he wanted.
OL,17,F"I like working with my hands," the
OL,18,F25-year-old said. "When I did [the
OL,19,Fapprenticeship], I did feel like it was
OL,20,Fmore my speed.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
